+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: breadth-first search finds each unique tree path in O(V+E); "
+        "at the shipping preset selftest measures its exact edge scans and wall "
+        "clock, while affine decoding plus parent chains takes under 300 exact "
+        "arithmetic operations."
